OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference awards honour
OL,4,Alocal heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who organises events to combat
OL,7,Fisolation, a young fundraiser, and the
OL,8,Ffounder of an animal sanctuary were
OL,9,Famong eight people honoured at a
OL,10,Fceremony celebrating their outstanding
OL,11,Fcontribution to the local community.
OL,13,FThe BBC Radio Tees Make a Difference
OL,14,FAwards heard inspiring stories from
OL,15,Facross the region of those who went
OL,16,Fabove and beyond to make life better
OL,17,Ffor others.
