OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference awards honour
OL,4,Alocal heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA panel of celebrity judges, including
OL,7,FStrictly's Lewis Cope, Smoggie Queen's
OL,8,FPhil Dunning and double jeopardy law
OL,9,Fcampaigner Ann Ming, selected the
OL,10,Fwinners from thousands of nominations.
OL,12,FThe awards were presented on Sunday at
OL,13,FHardwick Hall by breakfast show
OL,14,Fpresenter Amy Oakden and the afternoon
OL,15,Fshow's Scott Makin.
